{
  "id": "COL.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "COL",
  "reference": "Bakolose 3",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "COL 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kikalīle kapya mulī Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ūlū ng'wamala kūjūūchiwa hamò na Kilisito, īkoobagi īyo īlī kwigūlya, ūko alī ū Kilisito, igashije kū nkono gwa būlyo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A maganiko ging'we galogejagi kū mihayo ya kwigūlya, yaya ū kū ya mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we muchile, nīyo ū būpanga wing'we būbisilwe mulī Mulungu hamò na Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyūshika ī likanza lya koolechiwa ū Kilisito ūyo alī būpanga wise, na a bing'we hū mukwilonga ū ng'wikūjo hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, jibūlagagi ī nhūngwa jing'we ī ja kashimīzīle ka mu sī, gītī, būjingi, būsoso, būhahaalīzu, kwikūmva kwabūbi, kwikūmva sabo, (ūyo gūlī mhayo gwa kūlamya shikolo). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū būpelanu bo ng'wa Mulungu būkabizīīlaga a bashitiigwa kūlwa mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we h'ūmo ng'washimīzīlaga aho ng'walī mutaalī ū mu mihayo yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha īponyagi gete ī mihayo gītī, būpelanu, būkalī, būbi; nū mu milomo ying'we wīnge ū būsondagūji nū būdūkani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwilemba, nguno ng'wanzuulile ū munhū wa kale hamò nī shītīle shakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ūnzwala munhū mpya, ūyo akongejaga kūbeejiwa būpya ū mu witegeleja, ongeje kūbiza mu suso ya nsūmbi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mhayo gwenūyū atīho wa kūbalwa gīkī ūyū Nyunani nūūlū Nyudaya; ūyū asaalilwe nūūlū atasaalilwe, nūūlū gīkī ūyū misa, ūyū muna mahanga, ūyū nsese, ūyū ntungūlwa, alīyo ū Kilisito alī shose mu bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bing'we basolwa, abo mulī beela na batogwa ba ng'wa Mulungu, zwalagi nhūngwa ja kwisaatwa, kwichīla shigongo, widohya, būlyehu na wiyūmīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wiyūmīlīja būlī ng'wene ū kū biye, nīyo ng'wilekeja ūlū alīho munhū alī na mhayo gwa kūnsaayīla ng'wiye, na a bing'we ng'wiyītīla gīt'ūmo wang'wītīla a bing'we ū Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya yose yenīyo tūūlagi ho būtogwa, nguno ū wene būkūbanīgije pyī ī yose mu būshikanu bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ī mhola ya ng'wa Kilisito īsuge ū mu ng'holò jing'we, gīt'ūmo kitanīlwe king'we kalī mu mīlī gūmò; na bizagi banhū ba kūlūmba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mhayo go ng'wa Kilisito gūbize mo ū mu bing'we, nīyo gūmukwīlīle. Mudūle kūyilanga na kwihūgūla bing'we benekīlī na benekīlī mu witegeleja bose, mu Zabuli na mīmbo, na mīmbo ga mu moyo; hamò na kūng'wīmbīla Mulungu na būyegi ū mung'holò jing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo būlī gwene ūyo mukūgwītaga, ībize mu kayombele nūūlū mu shītwa; pye yītagi mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba Yesu, kūnū mukūnkumīlījaga Mulungu Sīswe mulī we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we bakīma ng'widohya ū kū bagoshi bing'we gīt'ūmo shiigelile kūlī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we bagosha batogagwi a bake bing'we, nīyo yaya ū kūbakalīhīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we baana ng'ūbigwa mu yose a babyaji bing'we, nguno ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlī gwawiza ū kūlī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bing'we bababa yaya ū kūbasaayīcha a baana bing'we batizūgwa ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we basese ng'ūbigwa mu yose a basīng'we būgonzo mu mīlī, ītī ng'wikanza īlo balīmubona dūhū, gītī bachooji ba kūyeja banhū, alīyo ng'ogohagi Seeba nang'holò īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī gwene ūyo mulīgwīta gwītagi kūfuma mu gatī ya ng'holò, gītī mulīntūmamīla Seeba, yaya ū kūbiza gītī mukūbatūmamīlaga banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managi gīkī mukwanukūla mheela ya wingīji kūfuma kūlī Seeba, nguno mukūntūmamīlaga Seeba Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo akwītaga yabūbi, akwanukūla īyo yigeleelilwe būbi wa nhūmamīle yakwe, būtīho būsolanhyiwa a ha gatī ya banhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
